{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Currently, Eutolant Saga will be available in Japanese only. Future localization plans are undecided.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Path of Domination or Liberation? \u2014 A Classic Fantasy SRPG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A peaceful nation engulfed in war. You are an apprentice knight who rises to face this crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the princess in escaping the advancing army, rally your allies, and travel across the world to reclaim your homeland.<br>In a meticulously crafted fantasy world, <strong>only you can command the battlefield, strategize, and restore peace to the continent!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470020/extras/320e08e7dabe726e59b9318800938c59.avif?t=1757565980\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Simple Yet Strategic System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Fast-paced turn-based battles with no screen transitions!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Form a party of over 40 unique allies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Characters' stats grow randomly!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Special items available to support struggling characters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>No permadeath\u2014no need to reset!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Even without permadeath, injuries carry consequences!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470020/extras/109a5e9a3e71e1df693d11a3453035e9.avif?t=1757565980\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lively Character Interactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A war chronicle brought to life by over\u00a0<strong>120 unique characters</strong>, <br>blending <strong>moments of deep drama with lighthearted banter!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>a rich and engaging script</strong>, the story unfolds through lively interactions and dynamic character dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470020/extras/f5e6a2fc82ed8e9a84475c29d450b442.avif?t=1757565980\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Mouse Operation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse operation is only supported when the resolution is set to 1920x1080px.  <br>If you would like to use the mouse in fullscreen mode, open the game.ini file in the game folder and change the setting to:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HardwareFullScreen=0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, please note the following side effects:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will not be able to change the window size.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The screen may be stretched to fit your monitor\u2019s resolution.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resolution Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports <strong>1920x1080px and Full Screen mode only</strong>.  <br>If playing on a <strong>1920x1080px monitor</strong>, press <strong>F4</strong> to switch to Full Screen mode for the best experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note for Steam Deck Users</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game uses <strong>MP4 format</strong> for in-game videos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Steam Deck, videos may not play correctly <strong>unless your environment supports MP4 playback</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please ensure that your Steam Deck setup can handle MP4 files if you wish to view all video content properly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recommended Users</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of Fantasy Worlds</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovers of Traditional SRPGs</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoyers of Character Interactions</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u7b2c\uff11\u7ae0\u30af\u30ea\u30a2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3470020/c7aba05e238506f402db018092f8e15c89c92d4a.jpg"},{"name":"\u7b2c\uff12\u7ae0\u30af\u30ea\u30a2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3470020/f8bff6e52b4d2e456ef9c8dca52db464cdb67f7e.jpg"},{"name":"\u7b2c\uff13\u7ae0\u30af\u30ea\u30a2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3470020/01a662843287e9f7416474b4a2386058d4825a43.jpg"},{"name":"\u7b2c\uff14\u7ae0\u30af\u30ea\u30a2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3470020/a26b7c98be9ee15db9eb8c0634ddac2227ea3a98.jpg"},{"name":"\u7b2c\uff15\u7ae0\u30af\u30ea\u30a2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3470020/8e29f65170893fa7c2f6e7a8be45bef5c76b3410.jpg"},{"name":"\u7b2c\uff16\u7ae0\u30af\u30ea\u30a2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3470020/becaf24584bae8cbb839a07e546a98e75b54f6ef.jpg"},{"name":"\u7b2c\uff17\u7ae0\u30af\u30ea\u30a2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3470020/0f809a3dc3aac76f3db0eaf73f269c5d79110725.jpg"},{"name":"\u7b2c\uff18\u7ae0\u30af\u30ea\u30a2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3470020/98bb5aea5ea2a47c92a1de1d59d3e0731fc4844e.jpg"},{"name":"\u7b2c\uff19\u7ae0\u30af\u30ea\u30a2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3470020/3822d3f15ce5fd7f983b85b94e29a1108a74cd39.jpg"},{"name":"\u7b2c\uff11\uf